=Categorize these {{ $json.newsletter.industry }} articles.

Categories: {{ Object.keys($json.categories).join(', ') }}

For each: assign ONE category, write 1-sentence summary (max 100 chars), score importance 1-10.

Articles: {{ JSON.stringify($json.articles.map((a,i) => ({id:i, title:a.title, desc:a.description?.substring(0,150)}))) }}

Respond JSON only: {"categorized":[{"id":0,"category":"Name","summary":"...","importance":8},...]}

